      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10488483::web::016::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf coating reduces surface chalking and pulverization relative to the uncoated alloy.",
